oso:ResearchInfrastructure <http://data.bioontology.org/metadata/prefixIRI> "OSO:ResearchInfrastructure";
                           a owl:Class;
                           rdfs:comment "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@ro,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@pt,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@it,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@fr,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@es,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@en,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@el,
                                        "A research infrastructure may bring together one or more Regional Facilities"@no;
                           rdfs:label "Research Infrastructure"@ro,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@pt,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@no,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@it,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@fr,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@es,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@en,
                                      "Research Infrastructure"@el;
                           rdfs:subClassOf foaf:Organization,
                                           <https://w3id.org/cerif/vocab/Organisation>;
                           skos:definition "The following definition for RI from Article 2 (6) of the Regulation (EU) No 1291/2013 of 11 December 2013: `Establishing Horizon 2020 - the Framework Programme for Research and Innovation (2014- 2020)` applies: “RI are facilities, resources and services that are used by the research communities to conduct research and foster innovation in their fields. They include: major scientific equipment (or sets of instruments), knowledge-based resources such as collections, archives and scientific data, einfrastructures, such as data and computing systems and communication networks and any other tools that are essential to achieve excellence in research and innovation.” Accordingly, RI are implemented along different organisational models, including central sources and laboratories for experiments and measurement sessions, coordination and management of geographically distributed observatories or laboratories, remotely accessible resources for computing, data banks, physical sample repositories, surveys and longitudinal studies."@en;
                           skos:note "RI"@fr,
                                     "RI"@en;
                           skos:prefLabel "Research Infrastructure"@ro,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@pt,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@no,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@it,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@fr,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@es,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@en,
                                          "Research Infrastructure"@el.
oso:ResearchProject a owl:Class;
                    rdfs:comment "Una actividad científica estructurada destinada a producir nuevo conocimiento, datos o comprensión dentro de un alcance y una duración definidos."@es,
                                 "O activitate științifică structurată destinată să producă noi cunoștințe, date sau înțelegere într-un cadru și o durată definite."@ro,
                                 "En strukturert vitenskapelig aktivitet som har som mål å produsere ny kunnskap, data eller forståelse innenfor et definert omfang og tidsrom."@no,
                                 "A structured scientific activity designed to produce new knowledge, data, or understanding within a defined scope and duration."@en,
                                 "Un'attività scientifica strutturata progettata per produrre nuova conoscenza, dati o comprensione entro un ambito e una durata definiti."@it,
                                 "Une activité scientifique structurée visant à produire de nouvelles connaissances, données ou compréhensions dans un périmètre et une durée définis."@fr,
                                 "Επιστημονική δραστηριότητα με σαφή δομή που αποσκοπεί στην παραγωγή νέας γνώσης, δεδομένων ή κατανόησης, εντός καθορισμένου πλαισίου και διάρκειας."@el,
                                 "Uma atividade científica estruturada concebida para produzir novo conhecimento, dados ou compreensão dentro de um âmbito e duração definidos."@pt;
                    rdfs:label "Ερευνητικό έργο"@el,
                               "Projeto de investigação"@pt,
                               "Projet de recherche"@fr,
                               "Research project"@en,
                               "Forskningsprosjekt"@no,
                               "Progetto di ricerca"@it,
                               "Proyecto de investigación"@es,
                               "Proiect de cercetare"@ro;
                    rdfs:subClassOf foaf:Project.
